Module LAPT_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_0RB0LD_0RB1LC.
(** * LAPT_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_0RB0LD_0RB1LC: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 0RB1LC_1LA1RB_0RB0LD_0RB1LC, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

