  apply (fire_of_run_instr tm Cc true true l B0_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_0RD0LA_0RB0LD p j [] []);
    [exact Hst | reflexivity | reflexivity | exact (gso_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_0RD0LA_0RB0LD p j E)].
Qed.

